       equipment item id below is a real, already-shipped Native item (verified against
       SandBoxCore/ModuleData/items/*.xml's own <Item>/<CraftedItem> definitions).
       Tier structure (6/11/16/21/26/31) and per-tier skill-point totals (90/195/360/508/676/835)
       match this mod's own audited standard, reusing byzantine_custom_troops.xml's exact
       per-branch skill numbers since the branch roles line up directly.
       Historical grounding: Azat (Armenian middle/lower nobility, light troops), Naxarar
       (the great feudal lords, heavy/elite troops), Ayrudzi ("horseman" - Armenian cavalry) and
       Azatagund (the elite noble heavy cavalry - armored cataphracts fighting with lance,
       longsword, and composite bow), Sparapet (commander-in-chief of the army) and Aspet
       (commander of the cavalry) as elite unit/rank names. -->

